   "fieldtype": "Select",
   "label": "Bot Mode",
   "options": "Test\nProd",
   "default": "Test",
   "reqd": 1,
   "in_list_view": 1,
   "description": "Test redirects every outbound send (campaigns, AI replies, auto-reply rules, polls) to the Test WA Group below, whatever the original target was. Prod sends to the real target — all real groups, collections and geo targets. AI drafting, tagging and rollups run identically in both modes; only actual message delivery is affected."
  },
